# S-173 / TST-7, live: a row dragged onto a folder header and onto a Space chip, in the
# open sidebar and in the rail (tooling/drive <profile> 40-tst7-drags.steps), on a
# profile 10-setup.steps built for this run alone: Home holds A, Folder[B], C, D.
# dragstart / dragmove / shot / dragend capture the highlight while the button is down.
# GUESS marks a coordinate to confirm against setup-02-open.png and setup-03-rail.png.
activate
wait 3
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-00-start.png
# 1. Open sidebar: Page D (GUESS y = 327) onto the folder header (GUESS y = 189).
dragstart 150 347
dragmove 150 260
dragmove 150 211
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-01a-open-over-header.png
dragend
wait 1.5
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-01b-open-joined.png
# 2. Open sidebar: Page C onto the Work chip. With D in the folder the rows read
# A 143, header 189, B 235, D 281, C 327 (GUESS).
dragstart 150 347
dragmove 160 600
dragmove 182 848
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-02a-open-over-chip.png
dragend
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-02b-open-moved.png
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
# 3. The rail.
click 102 14
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-03-rail.png
# 4. Rail: Page A (GUESS y = 168) onto the folder's glyph (GUESS y = 218).
dragstart 42 198
dragmove 42 200
dragmove 42 247
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-04a-rail-over-glyph.png
dragend
wait 1.5
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-04b-rail-joined.png
# 5. Rail: Page B, inside the folder (GUESS y = 218 once A has left the top: header 168,
# B 218, D 268, A 318), onto the Work chip in the rail's stack (GUESS 41, 770: read the
# stack's place from setup-03-rail.png).
dragstart 42 247
dragmove 42 500
dragmove 41 770
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-05a-rail-over-chip.png
dragend
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 2.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-05b-rail-moved.png
# 6. Whether drag 4 joined the folder: the rail draws a folder's rows without an indent,
# so "folder, B, D, A" reads the same whether Page A is in the folder or after it. Back in
# Home, the open sidebar shows it: the folder holding Page D and Page A, both indented.
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
click 42 50
wait 2
hover 700 500
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst7-06-home-open.png
